<title>USA: Norstan Inc Q4 April 30 net rises.</title>
<headline>Norstan Inc Q4 April 30 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>PLYMOUTH, Minn. 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>(In thousands, except per share amounts)</p>
<p>			  For the Quarter Ended  For the Year Ended</p>
<p>				Apr 30,     Apr 30,  Apr 30,  Apr 30,</p>
<p>				  1997	   1996     1997     1996</p>
<p> Revenues		  $116,115     $88,627 $398,075 $321,364</p>
<p> Cost of sales	     86,097	63,149  289,560  229,980</p>
